WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:06,970
Ms. Shen, the parsley truck you rented has been delivered to the underground garage of the community.

2
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,010
Is it convenient for you to come down and hand over now?

3
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,210
It's convenient. I'll be down soon.

4
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,850
It's not safe for him to be alone at home

5
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:13,930
It’s too much trouble to bring downstairs

6
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,010
You can only put it in the space first

7
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:17,130
Anyway, after going in, I’m just going to sleep.

8
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,290
I'll pick you up when I come back

9
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,420
The frame has been checked

10
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,060
If you have any questions within two months, please contact us directly

11
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,060
OK thank you

12
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:31,770
There's no need to go upstairs

13
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:32,890
Just keep stocking up tonight

14
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:36,510
BBQ is the perfect way to satisfy your cravings

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:38,670
Lamb skewers, beef skewers, chicken wings, grilled vegetables

16
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:39,910
Everything I usually like to eat is 10%

17
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,160
You should stock up on milk tea

18
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,600
If the pastor wants to drink from now on, he won’t have anywhere to buy it.

19
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:49,540
Pizza, 50 servings per hour

20
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,140
Fifty pounds of braised duck of each variety

21
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:53,460
20,000 yuan flowers

22
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,540
Don't spend the money now

23
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:55,660
It will be useless paper in three months
